<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλλ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, as Adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leafy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					21.340
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> usu. as
				Subst., <i>heap, bed,</i> or <i>litter of leaves,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλλάδα ἐπιβαλών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. στιπτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				1.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1183
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>foliage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίζης γὰρ οὔσης φ. ἵκετ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					966
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. μυριόκαρπος,</span> of a thick
			grove, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				676
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεμενία φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					754
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. Παρνασία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					1100
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλλάδος ἤδη κατακαρφομένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					79
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); also, <i>leafy branch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				398
			</span></i> (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλισίαι ἐκ φυλλάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					19.22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.13
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				3.10.6
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>salad,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Mnesim.
				4.31
			</span></i> (anap.), Diphil. <i><span class="en">
				18.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.71
			</span></i>.</div>
